package/ffmpeg: 8.0.3, for the V4L2 Request hwaccels of ffmpeg 8

Buildroot 2026.05 packages ffmpeg 6.1.5 (master: 7.0.3). The board's
decoder path is Kwiboo's v4l2-request series, now on ffmpeg 8
(patches/ffmpeg/, the same 13 patches as LEHU OS's AGL ffmpeg 8.0.3).

- the version and the tarball's hash; LICENSE.md changed, the COPYINGs not;
- ffmpeg 8 no longer knows --enable/--disable-postproc (libpostproc was
  removed) or --disable-crystalhd, and its configure stops on an unknown
  option: both dropped. BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG_POSTPROC stays (kodi and vlc
  select it) and builds nothing;
- Buildroot's patches: 0002 still applies; 0006 and 0007 are in 8.0.3;
  0001 (x86 without SSSE3) applies only with fuzz, which Buildroot refuses,
  and 0003 (mips), 0004 (static extralibs) and 0005 (mmal) no longer apply;
  none of them matters to this board's builds: removed;
- the libudev build-order dependency that scripts/build.sh used to add with
  sed (--enable-libudev comes from BR2_PACKAGE_FFMPEG_EXTRACONF).

Applied to the Buildroot checkout by scripts/build.sh (patches/buildroot/).

